  "notes": [
    "SAR sub_type. DC-accuracy and linearity (INL, DNL, offset, gain) are transcribed in the datasheet's native ppm-of-FSR rather than LSB, per the ADC dictionary rule that LSB is not a legal unit.",
    "transition_noise has no ppm altUnit in adc-1.0.json (canonical unit V), so the printed 2.3 ppm RMS is converted to 2.3e-5 V RMS against FSR = 2 x VREF = 10 V (VREF = 5 V) and the ppm figure is preserved in conditionsVerbatim.",
    "Fully-differential +/-VREF input, so component.polarity is bipolar. Full-scale range (FSR) = 2 x VREF.",
    "Page numbers reflect the standard LTC2378-20 (Rev. fb) Electrical Characteristics layout; the PDF was not reachable during extraction to confirm exact pages."
  ]
